						<tr>
							<td height="50" colspan="3" valign="top" class="windowbg2" align="left">It was great to see so many people from so many different guilds coming out to help.&nbsp; Many congratulations to Faelin on finally getting that mob down!!!&nbsp; &nbsp;<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/yourock.gif" alt="yourock" border="0" /></td>
