							<td height="50" colspan="3" valign="top" class="windowbg2" align="left">Prodigy - the instances in which I petitioned were the ones that people were ultimately banned for.&nbsp; If you&#039;re still waiting for a comment from a GM, you missed the boat, because they&#039;ve already spoken.<br /><br />As for the previous top 10 issue with DN, that was due to issues completely different from this, and it was beaten to death in about 7 pages of flames already.&nbsp; I really don&#039;t think you want all those issues brought up again.<br /><br />I&#039;m not against gimping in one or two people into a zone for a grind, or even to gear up twinks.&nbsp; What I AM against, is gimping in 10+ people to have them log out as soon as they are gimped in, and then have them all log in on cue, use around 2 minutes of DPS to take out an Msha, then camp out before they&#039;re booted.&nbsp; That&#039;s circumventing the system, and its not how the 85% rule was intended to work.</td>
