						<tr>
							<td height="50" colspan="3" valign="top" class="windowbg2" align="left"><div class="quoteheader"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1585.msg17300#msg17300">Quote from: Raitnar on May 26, 2005, 05:55:04 pm</a></div><div class="quote">I have a question for everyone that is throwing this stuff around. Why haven&#039;t you done a /petition? Why bother going on about it here, when you can do something constructive about it? God damn, it&#039;s simple. If you believe somebody is cheating, and you have seen it, DO SOMETHING ABOUT IT!!! <br /></div><br />I have petitioned DN members for cheating.&nbsp; Multiple times.&nbsp; If I continue to see it, I&#039;ll continue to petition it.</td>
